\title{cfbfastR: Access College Football Play by Play Data}
\description{
\if{html}{\figure{logo.png}{options: style='float: right' alt='logo' width='120'}}

A utility to quickly obtain clean and tidy college football data. Wraps the 'CollegeFootballData' API \url{https://collegefootballdata.com/}, the 'ESPN' college football API \url{https://www.espn.com}, and the 'Fox Sports' and 'Yahoo Sports' college football feeds; loads pre-built play-by-play, box score, roster and team datasets from the 'SportsDataverse' data releases; and supplements play-by-play with expected points added, win probability added, field goal, fourth down, two point conversion, expected pass, completion probability and quarterback rating models.
}
